 of barrel and handguard modifications</strong>.</p>\n<p>- <strong>5 types of receiver and stock options</strong>.</p>\n<p>- <strong>Charging handle</strong> configurable to <strong>reciprocating</strong> or <strong>non-reciprocating with bolt</strong>.</p>\n<p>Models and textures are properties of <strong>Activision</strong>.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-2\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Setup and Usage</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>1. Unzip the downloaded files.</p>\n<p>2. Drop the mod folder in to the spt directory.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-3\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Permissions and Legal</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>- <strong>When reuploading or sharing this mod</strong>, please clearly indicate the author or source.</p>\n<p>- <strong>Do not distribute files with the <code>.bundle</code> extension</strong> (or its variants) from this mod without permission.</p>\n<p>- Respect the original creator’s rights as these models and textures are properties of <strong>Activision</strong>.</p></div></div>\n<div id=\"tabset-1-panel-4\" class=\"tab-panel\"><div class=\"tab-title\">Credits</div>\n<div class=\"tab-content\"><p>- <strong>Original models and textures:</strong> Activision</p>\n<p>- <strong>Special thanks to:</strong> <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://hub.sp-tarkov.com/user/18902-massivesoft/\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Massivesoft</a></p></div></div></div>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.1.0", "spt_version_constraint": "~3.11.0", "content_length": null, "downloads": 4252, "published_at": "2025-05-26T05:17:08.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/2157/mcw-rifle/1.1.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}], "repos": ["AlmightyTank/Mass_MCW"], "source_code_links": [{"url": "https://github.com/AlmightyTank/Mass_MCW", "label": ""}], "required_by": 0, "no_